@{ ViewData["Title"]="About the demo"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE VINTERNSHIPS</p><h1>A workspace you can try yourself.</h1><p>No registration, passwords or external services needed.</p></div></div>
<div class="detail-layout"><section class="panel detail-panel"><h2>Try a placement from start to finish</h2><ol class="steps"><li><a asp-controller="Student" asp-action="Create">Add a fictional student</a> with an example email.</li><li><a asp-controller="Company" asp-action="Index">Choose a sample company</a> or add your own fictional record.</li><li><a asp-controller="Internship" asp-action="Create">Create a placement</a> with a position and dates.</li><li>Open the placement to add hours and supervisor feedback.</li></ol><p>All visitors can explore the same features. This demo has no accounts or role permissions.</p></section><section class="panel detail-panel"><h2>Your changes are temporary</h2><p>This browser has its own sample workspace. Other visitors receive separate records. A workspace expires after 45 minutes and all sample records are lost when the application restarts.</p><p>Limits: 50 students, 25 companies and 75 placements per workspace; 20 active workspaces in total.</p><form asp-action="Reset" method="post"><button class="btn btn-outline-danger" type="submit">Reset my sample workspace</button></form><p class="small-note">Reset immediately replaces only your sample records. Any forms open in another tab will need to be reloaded.</p></section></div>
